---

<section
  class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-10"
>
  <div>
    <p class="text-2xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em]">
      Audio tool
      <b class="text-accent">/</b>
    </p>
    <h1
      class="my-7 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(3.5rem,7vw,6.75rem)] font-medium leading-display tracking-display"
    >
      Cortar audio online<i class="not-italic text-accent">.</i>
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-xl text-xs text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">
      Divide audios largos en partes limpias desde tu navegador. El archivo no
      se sube a ningun servidor.
    </p>
  </div>

  <aside
    class="self-end border-y border-line py-5 text-3xs uppercase tracking-label text-muted dark:border-line-dark dark:text-muted-dark"
  >
    <dl class="grid gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <dt>Maximo</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">40 min</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <dt>Salida</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">WAV + ZIP</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <dt>Motor</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark">PCM local</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>
